    {
      "id": "stroke-control-template-landing",
      "type": "content",
      "label": "Stroke Control Landing",
      "root": false,
      "position": {
        "x": -227.08115560388785,
        "y": -581.1368733195291
      },
      "width": 520,
      "height": 220,
      "visible": true,
      "showLabel": true,
      "data": {
        "identity": {
          "graphId": "stroke-control-template"
        },
        "content": {
          "kind": "markdown",
          "value": "# Stroke Control\n\nOne paint layer implemented as typed Property nodes: color, width, opacity, dash, and enabled. Create a separate copy of this graph for every independently editable layer. In each copy, set the export Bridge reference to the consuming Edge Class graph so its Property events reach that graph. Add an import Bridge to each copy in the Edge Class; Bridge order defines paint order."
        },
        "_placement": {
          "version": 1,
          "state": "manually-shaped",
          "source": "manual",
          "updatedAt": 1791315217932,
          "reason": "node-drag"
        }
      }
    },
